105
00:32:06,343 --> 00:32:07,753
泣かないと決めたあの日から
Since the day I decided not to cry,

106
00:32:07,753 --> 00:32:10,343
本当はずっと苦しかった
It's actually been painful all along.

107
00:32:10,543 --> 00:32:12,653
叫んでも変わらない世界に
In a world that doesn't change no matter how I scream,

108
00:32:12,653 --> 00:32:15,583
爪を立て 牙を剥け 炎を灯せ
Grow claws, bare your fangs, and light the flames!

109
00:32:21,743 --> 00:32:22,973
「どうしようもない」
"There's nothing I can do,"

110
00:32:23,113 --> 00:32:25,693
呟いて誤魔化したかった 羨望 理想像
I muttered, wishing to mask my envy and ideals.

111
00:32:25,923 --> 00:32:27,083
「くだらない」
"How pointless,"

112
00:32:27,193 --> 00:32:29,833
吐き捨てて手前横切った 激情走馬灯
I spat out as a flash of intense passion crossed my mind.

113
00:32:30,083 --> 00:32:32,403
誰かが決めた正解と幸せ
The "correct answers" and happiness someone else decided,

114
00:32:32,583 --> 00:32:34,543
“自分らしさ”に縛られて
Bound by "being yourself,"

115
00:32:34,713 --> 00:32:37,863
比べた分遠のく夢 これが生き様か？
A dream that drifts further away the more I compare—is this how I live?

116
00:32:38,523 --> 00:32:40,313
ignite my soul

117
00:32:40,443 --> 00:32:42,983
抗う野生 戦うことをやめちゃいけない
Rebel wildlife, you mustn't stop fighting!

118
00:32:43,255 --> 00:32:45,755
(I'm a survivor , I'm a fighter)
(I'm a survivor, I'm a fighter)

119
00:32:45,955 --> 00:32:49,555
紛れもない僕にしか僕を救うこと出来ないから
Because no one else but undeniable me can save myself.

120
00:32:49,855 --> 00:32:52,055
(I'm a survivor , I'm a fighter)
(I'm a survivor, I'm a fighter)

121
00:32:52,205 --> 00:32:53,555
いま、黎明
Now, at dawn.

122
00:32:54,423 --> 00:32:57,363
「あれがほしい」 簡単には言葉に出来たらいいのに 逃げ癖
"I want that"—if only I could easily put it into words, my habit of running away.

123
00:32:57,623 --> 00:33:00,513
「かわりたい」 変わらないのは世界じゃなくて僕なんだ 気付いたんだ
"I want to change"—I realized that what doesn't change isn't the world, but me.

124
00:33:00,883 --> 00:33:03,383
与えられた安全圏 熟す道化
A given safety zone, a ripening clown.

125
00:33:03,543 --> 00:33:05,523
型破り アウトローの勝利
Unconventional, an outlaw's victory.

126
00:33:05,683 --> 00:33:09,023
正攻法じゃ もうカンスト ここが正念場か
With a straightforward approach, it's already maxed out—is this the crucial moment?

127
00:33:09,483 --> 00:33:11,163
ignite my soul

128
