(I'm a survivor , I'm a fighter)
(I'm a survivor, I'm a fighter)

130
00:33:17,055 --> 00:33:21,055
誰でもない僕だけは僕を信じて貫きたいから
Because I want to believe in and push through with only myself, no one else.

131
00:33:21,255 --> 00:33:23,855
(I'm a survivor , I'm a fighter)
(I'm a survivor, I'm a fighter)

132
00:33:24,055 --> 00:33:26,055
