A voice is coming from somewhere.

133
00:33:26,255 --> 00:33:29,555
傷付きながらでも辿り着いた激動
The turbulence I reached even while getting hurt,

134
00:33:29,855 --> 00:33:33,055
叫ぶ本能 戦うことをやめちゃいけない
Screaming instinct, you mustn't stop fighting!

135
00:33:33,255 --> 00:33:35,855
(I'm a survivor , I'm a fighter)
(I'm a survivor, I'm a fighter)

136
00:33:36,055 --> 00:33:38,055
ほら、鮮明
Look, vividly clear.

137
00:33:39,055 --> 00:33:41,555
泣かないと決めたあの日から
