143
00:33:56,855 --> 00:33:59,555
(I'm a survivor , I'm a fighter)
(I'm a survivor, I'm a fighter)

144
00:33:59,855 --> 00:34:04,055
紛れもない僕にしか僕を救うこと出来ないから
Because no one else but undeniable me can save myself.

145
00:34:04,255 --> 00:34:06,555
(I'm a survivor , I'm a fighter)
(I'm a survivor, I'm a fighter)

146
00:34:06,855 --> 00:34:09,555
何処からか声がするのさ
A voice is coming from somewhere.

147
00:34:09,855 --> 00:34:12,555
傷だらけの僕が生き抜いた勲章
The medal won by my scarred self surviving through,

148
00:34:12,855 --> 00:34:15,555
叫ぶ本能 戦うことは生きることだ
Screaming instinct, fighting is living!

149
00:34:15,855 --> 00:34:18,555
(I'm a survivor , I'm a fighter)
(I'm a survivor, I'm a fighter)

150
00:34:18,855 --> 00:34:21,555
さあ、黎明
Now, at dawn.

151
00:35:04,588 --> 00:35:07,388
ネオンライトは眩く
Neon lights are dazzling,

152
00:35:07,388 --> 00:35:09,488
街灯明滅 通り過ぎ
streetlights flickering as I pass by.

153
00:35:09,488 --> 00:35:12,088
窓の向こう 夜の風に
Through the window, in the night wind,

154
00:35:12,088 --> 00:35:13,988
空を見た
I looked up at the sky.

155
00:35:14,588 --> 00:35:17,688
忙しい足取り 私だけが
A busy pace, as if only I

156
00:35:17,688 --> 00:35:19,488
取り残されたようで
was left behind,

157
00:35:19,488 --> 00:35:22,188
また光に揺られる
swaying in the light once more.

158
00:35:22,188 --> 00:35:26,188
心の中で私を消して
Erasing myself within my heart.

159
00:35:26,988 --> 00:35:29,688
追いかけた過去 背中合わせの
The chased past and back-to-back

160
00:35:29,688 --> 00:35:32,788
希望 密度 押しつぶされぬように
hope and density, so as not to be crushed—

161
00:35:33,488 --> 00:35:37,688
だから君と ここにいる時間は
That's why the time I spend here with you

162
00:35:37,688 --> 00:35:41,588
言葉にできず 見つめ合うだけ
cannot be put into words, just gazing at each other.

163
00:35:41,588 --> 00:35:45,688
思考回路 ぼやけたままで さあ
My thought circuits remaining blurred, now...

164
00:35:45,688 --> 00:35:47,888
光を掴むまで
until I grasp the light.

165
00:36:02,188 --> 00:36:04,488
何処まで往こうか
How far shall I go?

166
00:36:04,488 --> 00:36:06,888
ネイビーな夜空に映る
Reflected in the navy night sky,

167
00:36:06,888 --> 00:36:09,488
過去の自分
my past self—

168
00:36:09,488 --> 00:36:11,788
夢見がちだった
I was too prone to dreaming.

169
00:36:11,788 --> 00:36:14,088
見たくないモノ
The things I didn't want to see

170
00:36:14,088 --> 00:36:15,888
照らすハイビームに
illuminated by the high beams,

171
00:36:15,888 --> 00:36:18,088
走る焦燥感
a surging sense of impatience.

172
00:36:18,088 --> 00:36:20,788
跳ね除けて前へ往けば
Shaking it off and pushing forward,

173
00:36:20,788 --> 00:36:23,388
信号は全色を無くし消えた
the traffic lights lost all colors and vanished.

174
00:36:23,388 --> 00:36:26,888
確かめたい この道が繋ぐ場所を
I want to make sure where this road leads.

175
00:36:27,288 --> 00:36:30,188
深く、深く紺になる
Deeply, deeply turning dark navy,

176
00:36:30,188 --> 00:36:32,788
夜を往ける この加速度
this acceleration traveling through the night—

177
00:36:32,788 --> 00:36:35,388
光さえ超えてゆける程に
going fast enough to surpass even light.

178
00:36:35,388 --> 00:36:37,788
強く、強く踏み込んで
Stepping down firmly and strongly,

179
00:36:37,788 --> 00:36:40,388
僕は駈ける ただ真っ直ぐに
I run straight ahead,

180
00:36:40,388 --> 00:36:42,888
譲れない想いを抱いて
holding onto unyielding feelings.

181
00:36:42,888 --> 00:36:45,688
標識だらけの街を抜け出して
Slipping out of the sign-filled town,

182
00:36:45,688 --> 00:36:48,388
未来を探していた
I was searching for the future.

183
00:36:48,388 --> 00:36:51,688
常識も何も 全部雑踏と化していた
Common sense and everything else had turned into mere hustle and bustle.

184
00:36:51,688 --> 00:36:56,888
何処まで往けるのなんて聞き飽いた台詞吐いて
Uttering the tired line, "How far can you go?"

185
00:36:56,888 --> 00:37:00,488
曇った窓ガラスに書いた本音 すぐに指で消した
I wrote my true feelings on the foggy windowpane and quickly erased them with my finger.

186
00:37:00,488 --> 00:37:03,388
懦者でも揺るぎない軌跡
Even as a coward, an unwavering trajectory,

187
00:37:03,388 --> 00:37:07,888
確かな願いを胸に 遥か遠くへ
holding a certain wish close to my heart, far into the distance.

188
00:37:07,888 --> 00:37:11,588
錆び付くように躓いても
Even if I stumble as if rusting,

189
00:37:11,588 --> 00:37:14,588
この真っ暗闇を 燈し進む
I light up and press through this pitch darkness,

190
00:37:14,588 --> 00:37:17,588
ただ一つ 答えを追いかけて
chasing after just one answer.

191
00:37:17,588 --> 00:37:20,188
脆くても良い この腕で
Even if fragile, with these arms

192
00:37:20,188 --> 00:37:22,588
掴む為に手を伸ばすよ
I reach out to grasp it,

193
00:37:22,588 --> 00:37:25,188
打ち鳴らす鼓動の限り
to the limit of my beating heart.

194
00:37:25,188 --> 00:37:27,888
何度 この道で迷って
How many times have I lost my way on this road,

195
00:37:27,888 --> 00:37:30,888
見失って どこへ往くの
lost sight, and wondered where I'm going?

196
00:37:30,888 --> 00:37:35,388
目指す場所も その意味も 一つしかないのに
Even though there is only one destination and one meaning.

197
00:37:35,388 --> 00:37:39,388
曇った視界は 夜に溶けて もう一度
My cloudy vision dissolves into the night once more,

198
00:37:39,388 --> 00:37:42,188
視線の先 僕を連れて往くよ きっと
surely leading me ahead of my gaze.

199
00:37:42,188 --> 00:37:44,888
深く、深く紺になる
Deeply, deeply turning dark navy,

200
00:37:44,888 --> 00:37:47,588
息を吸って 今 加速を
taking a breath, now accelerating—

201
00:37:47,588 --> 00:37:50,188
傷付く程に強くなると
growing stronger the more I get hurt,

202
00:37:50,188 --> 00:37:52,588
確かな色動き出す
a true color begins to stir.

203
00:37:52,588 --> 00:37:56,388
纏ってゆけ その身体で
Wrap yourself in it, with that body,

204
00:37:56,388 --> 00:37:59,388
鮮やかな夜空の果てへ
to the edge of the vibrant night sky,

205
00:37:59,388 --> 00:38:02,388
忘れないように
so as not to forget.

206
00:38:02,388 --> 00:38:06,388
深く、深く 紺になれ 今を生きる
Deeply, deeply turn navy, living in the present,

207
00:38:06,388 --> 00:38:09,888
この加速の 光さえ超えてゆける 場所へ
to a place where I can surpass even the light of this acceleration.

208
00:38:09,888 --> 00:38:13,588
強く、強く 踏み込んで 僕は駆ける
Stepping down firmly and strongly, I run

209
00:38:13,588 --> 00:38:16,888
ただ真っ直ぐに 譲れない想いを抱いて
straight ahead, holding unyielding feelings.

210
00:38:16,888 --> 00:38:19,888
まだまだ走るよ みんなついてきて
We're still running! Everyone, follow me!

211
00:38:19,888 --> 00:38:22,888
どこまでいこうか マイビイビーな夜空に
How far shall we go into the baby-navy night sky?

212
00:38:22,888 --> 00:38:25,388
映る昨日の自分 夢見がちだった
My past self reflected there was so dreamy.

213
00:38:25,388 --> 00:38:28,188
ベイビーフェイスに さあ よなら
Now, goodbye to that baby face.

214
