視線の先 僕を連れて往くよ きっと
surely leading me ahead of my gaze.

223
00:39:04,888 --> 00:39:07,888
みんな生きろよ
Everyone, live on!

224
00:39:07,888 --> 00:39:11,588
深く深く紺になる 息を吸って 今加速を
Deeply, deeply turning navy, taking a breath, now accelerating—

225
00:39:11,588 --> 00:39:15,888
傷付く程に 強くなると 確かな色 動き出す
growing stronger the more I get hurt, a true color begins to stir.

226
